osts</article-title><source>Arch Int Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>160</volume><fpage>3278</fpage><lpage>3285</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11088090</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/archinte.160.21.3278</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lustman</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Freedland</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Groot</surname><given-names>Md</given-names></name><name><surname>Carney</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Clause</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Depression and Poor Glycemic Control: A Meta-Analytic Review of the Literature</article-title><source>Diabetes Care</source><year>2000</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>934</fpage><lpage>942</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10895843</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2337/diacare.23.7.934</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Husaini</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Hull</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Sherkat</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Emerson</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Overton</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Craun</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Cain</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Levine</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Diabetes, Depression, and Healthcare Utilization Among African Americans in Primary Care</article-title><source>J Natl Med Assoc</source><year>2004</year><volume>96</volume><fpage>476</fpage><lpage>484</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15101668</pub-id></citation></ref